WEBVTT

00:02:27.996 --> 00:02:30.876
in the Amazon forest,

00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:34.516
burning down because of economic interest.

00:02:35.516 --> 00:02:40.916
Turning this forest
from carbon sink to carbon source.

00:02:42.316 --> 00:02:48.396
We have witnessed, in Indonesia,
the swamps drained

00:02:48.436 --> 00:02:50.476
for palm oil plantations.

00:02:50.476 --> 00:02:54.516
Turning them from carbon sink
to carbon source.

